        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Wood chips, hardwood, u=80%, at forest
The volume refers to the bulked volume: dried matter content = 239 kg/m3 dried matter (u=0%), lower heating value = 4048 MJ/m3. Wood is unstored/undried and not stemming from short-rotation areas for energy wood production!;
Synonyms: Buche, Beech, Häcksel; 
UUID: 3531fff0-bac5-332a-bbbe-e8e4a1c7ccea
Includes the chopping of residual hardwood with a mobile chopper in the forest. Also includes the driving of the mobile chopper to and within the forest
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chopping with a large mobile chopper. Wood is unstored/undried and not stemming from short-rotation areas for energy wood production!
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Austria is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3531fff0-bac5-332a-bbbe-e8e4a1c7ccea.xml</text>
